Subject: [PATCH] WLANRTSYS-88975 iwlwav-hostap-ng DL SCS support

Description: Implementation of the Service Classified Stream- SCS feature.
The iwlwav-hostapd-ng must handle and parse the SCS Add, Remove and Change request.
All the changes are under the CONFIG_SCS_MXL flag.

Signed-off-by: Karthik D A <karthikda@maxlinear.com>
